      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOVE BY DESIGN (2) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at Q Parklands but was a Mix winner two back at this track. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Key player on best and worth another chance. NANGAR COUNTY (3) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing nine from 16 starts. Finished second (20.30) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Speedy beginner who should be prominent early on from an inside box. Winning chance. RUBY SHELBY (6) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 5.5 lengths into third (20.31) at this track in a Mix over 350m. Hard to beat again. ANNDAR SPIRIT (1) can find the frame without surprising.",
